akali Caves Road Andheri East Mumbai 400 093 |\n\nThe information provided on this page is collated from publicly available resources. PropTech Pulse does not guarantee the accuracy, completeness, or authority of this data and shall not be held liable for any discrepancies. For queries or further assistance, please contact us at [pulse@aurumproptech.in](mailto:pulse@aurumproptech.in)\n\n## Top Properties in Pune\n\n![Pexo Icon](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2Fassets%2Fpexo-ai%2Fpexo-strip.png&w=640&q=75)\n![Pexo Icon](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2Fassets%2Fpexo-ai%2Fpexo-strip.png&w=640&q=75)\n\nAsk Pulse Ai anything about real estate\n\nYour AI companion is available 24/7 — home loans, listings, market trends\n\n![pexo](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2FcommonAssets%2FshadowPexocha.webp&w=1200&q=75)\n\n## Unlock the Latest in Real Estate\n\nNews, Infographics, Blogs & More! Delivered to your inbox.\n\n![Proptech Pulse Logo](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2FcommonAssets%2Fpulse_logo_latest.png&w=1200&q=75)\n\n### Reach Out to Us\n\n### Reach Out to Us\n\n### Reach Out to Us\n\n### “Data that drives action. Insight that inspires action. Technology that empowers action.“\n\n### “Data that drives action. Insight that inspires action. Technology that empowers action.“\n\nMade with Love\n\n![Statue](/frontend/assets/aurum-kuberx/flag.webp)\n\n© PropTech Pulse 2026, All rights reserved.","images":[]},{"url":"https://blox.xyz/projects/sesen","title":"Sesen In Malabar Hill | Buy 5 BHK in Mumbai","raw_content":"Discover. Experience. Buy.\n\nGet Personalized experience\n\nby logging in\n\nLogin / Register\n\n[Properties in Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/1a256)\n\n>\n\n[Properties in Malabar Hill](/buy/mumbai/malabar-hill-1a256b7a209)\n\n>\n\nGroup Satellite\n\n>\n\nVIEW ALL\n\n# \n\nSesen, Nepeansea Road, Simla Nagar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400006\n\nMalabar Hill\n\n₹32.39 Cr\n\n₹32.39 Cr\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n[Price & Floor Plan](#Price & Floor Plan)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\nRising up from the heart of Mumbai, in the city’s most distinguished neighbourhood, is a tower that will elevate modern living to new heights. All great creations begin as inspiration. The name ‘Sesen’ is derived from the term used for the ancient Egyptian hieroglyph of a Lotus flower, the culture’s eternal symbol of the sun, creation and rebirth. Arising from this perennial idea of balance is Sesen’s holistic architecture, which represents a lifestyle befitting its iconic location. Sesen offers a residential experience that is singularly unique. Elegant and striking, the tower makes an imposing design statement in the city’s most prized residential neighbourhood. Modern style and rich heritage converge in this southern edge of Mumbai, where striking, wide vistas of the Arabian Sea are joined by green parks, exclusive clubs and cultural landmarks.\n\n5 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Dec 2024\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹67,000/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n4835 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Strategically Constructed Homes.\n* Intelligent home access control.\n* Good Lightening & Ventilation in all rooms.\n\n* Perfection is second nature.\n* Access to important landmarks.\n* Discover an exclusive life at a futuristic destination.\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nThe project is recognized as an uber-luxury residential tower featuring high-end duplexes and expansive sea-facing apartments. Reviewers frequently highlight the architectural inspiration from the Egyptian Lotus and the building's imposing presence in South Mumbai. Residents and visitors appreciate the exclusivity and the serene, spiritual atmosphere provided by the nearby Banganga Tank and Walkeshwar Temple. The property is noted for its high-quality construction and the premium lifestyle it offers to Mumbai's elite.\n\n### The good things\n\nStunning Vistas\n\nThe apartments offer unobstructed and breathtaking views of the Arabian Sea and the Queen's Necklace.\n\nPrime Location\n\nSituated in the prestigious Malabar Hill, providing proximity to elite clubs, top-tier schools, and renowned hospitals.\n\nWorld-Class Amenities\n\nThe project features luxury facilities including an infinity pool, private cinema, spa, and a modern gymnasium.\n\nSpacious Layouts\n\nHomes are designed with very large carpet areas and high ceilings, catering to families seeking significant personal space.\n\nPeaceful Environment\n\nDespite being in the heart of the city, the immediate surroundings are described as quiet, green, and a sanctuary from urban noise.\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nTraffic Congestion\n\nThe narrow roads leading to the hill and areas around Mukesh Chowk face heavy traffic and bottlenecking during peak hours.\n\nHigh Cost of Living\n\nThe exclusivity of the project and the neighborhood results in very high maintenance costs and expensive daily essentials.\n\nLimited Public Transport\n\nDependence on private vehicles is high as the area lacks immediate metro connectivity and has limited bus frequency.\n\nParking Constraints\n\nWhile the building provides internal parking, the surrounding neighborhood often struggles with inadequate space for visitors.\n\nMonsoon Waterlogging\n\nSome residents in the broader locality report issues with waterlogging on approach roads after heavy rainfall.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nUltimate luxury for HNIs\n\nUnmatched sea views\n\nExtremely prestigious address\n\nChallenging daily commute\n\nElite social circle\n\n## Amenities\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\nCar Parking Space\n\nGymnasium\n\nIndoor Games\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\nLarge Green Area\n\nMultipurpose Hall\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\nWalking Area\n\nWell Designed Entrance Lobby\n\nYoga Area\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\nCar Parking Space\n\nGymnasium\n\nIndoor Games\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\nLarge Green Area\n\nMultipurpose Hall\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\nWalking Area\n\nWell Designed Entrance Lobby\n\nYoga Area\n\n## Price & Floor Plan\n\n5 BHK\n\n* ## 4835 sq. ft\n\nName\n\n5 BHK\n\nPrice Range\n\n₹32.39 Cr\n\n## Locality\n\nschool\n\nbank\n\nhospital\n\nCumballa Hill High School\n\n0.3 km\n\nAaden International School\n\n0.3 km\n\nNew Activity School\n\n0.7 km\n\nThe New Era School\n\n0.7 km\n\nVilla Theresa High School\n\n0.7 km\n\nBombay International School\n\n0.9 km\n\n### Home Loan Calculator\n\nStarting from₹33,85,149per month\n\nExplore the cost of your home by adjusting the details\n\nTotal amount : ₹40,62,17,822\n\n## Enquire Now\n\nLet us reach out to you at the earliest.\n\n+91\n\nREQUEST A CALLBACK\n\nI am happy to be contacted by Blox\n\n## RERA QR Codes\n\nSesenis a real estate project registered under MahaRERA (Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority), ensuring transparency and accountability in its development.\n\nScan this RERA QR code to find out more or search ID here - <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in>\n\n[P51900005355](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51900005355)\n\nSesen\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### When is the possession date for Sesen?\n\nPossession date of Sesen is 30 Dec 2024\n\n### What is the RERA carpet area range of Sesen?\n\nThe RERA carpet area range for Sesen is 4835 sqft\n\n### What is the price range of Sesen?\n\nThe price range of Sesen is ₹32.39 Cr Onwards\n\n### Where is Sesen located?\n\nSesen is located at Sesen, Nepeansea Road, Simla Nagar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400006.\n\n### What configurations are available in Sesen?\n\nSesen has 5 BHK configurations.\n\n### What is the status of Sesen?\n\nThe status of Sesen is Ready to move.\n\n### Which amenities are provided in Sesen?\n\nThe amenities are CCTV / Video Surveillance, Car Parking Space, Gymnasium, Indoor Games, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Large Green Area, Multipurpose Hall, Senior citizen Area, Walking Area, Well Designed Entrance Lobby, Yoga Area.\n\n### Who is the developer of Sesen?\n\nThe developer of Sesen is Group Satellite.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n## Group Satellite\n\nFounded in the year 1970, Group Satellite is a trusted name in the real estate industry of Mumbai. With trust, transparency, and confidence, the company has been able to fulfill the dream of owning a home of a large number of customers. It is driven by the vision to be ethically, aesthetically, and operationally, Mumbai's real estate company of choice. It strives to lead Mumbai in the right direction through all its new product launches, by creating superior living with compact homes and making home-ownership a more widely distributed privilege.\n\n## Properties In The Same Area\n\nAnchor South Ridge\n\nMalabar Hill\n\n₹11.23 Cr\n\n3 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\nVinod 36 Babulnath\n\nMalabar Hill\n\n₹7.75 Cr - 10 Cr\n\n2, 3 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\nFairdeal Ocean 360\n\nMalabar Hill\n\n₹3.21 Cr - 5.77 Cr\n\n1, 3 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\nRunwal The Residence\n\nMalabar Hill\n\n₹19.2 Cr - 29.25 Cr\n\n2, 3, 4 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n## Similar Projects\n\nLodha Tardeo\n\nTardeo\n\n₹19 Cr - 32.6 Cr\n\n3, 4, 5 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\nProvenance Four Seasons Private Residences\n\nUpper Worli\n\n₹16.27 Cr - 36.36 Cr\n\n3, 5 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\nSugee Marina Bay\n\nWorli\n\n₹18 Cr - 36.6 Cr\n\n3, 4 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\nRustomjee Parishram\n\nBandra West\n\n₹17.73 Cr - 39.86 Cr\n\n3, 4, 5 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\nPrestige Daffodils\n\nBandra West\n\n₹26 Cr - 41.51 Cr\n\n4 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n## Properties for sale in Mumbai\n\n## Developers in Malabar Hill , Mumbai\n\n* [Fair Deal Infrastructure projects in Malabar Hill , Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/malabar-hill-fair-deal-infrastructure-1a256b7a209b13a3230)\n* [Runwal Developers projects in Malabar Hill , Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/malabar-hill-runwal-developers-1a256b7a209b13a15)\n* [Lodha Group projects in Malabar Hill , Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/malabar-hill-lodha-group-1a256b7a209b13a32)\n* [Group Satellite projects in Malabar Hill , M